            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Yes, it was written to solve that.\r\n\r\nSorry to nit pick, but *does* it solve that issue? As in did you try the steps from the issue and everything works as expected?\r\n\r\nMy main reason for asking this is that it uses `filename` with URI of the format `jdt:xxx`. While `vim.uri_to_fname()` [works only for `file:xxx` format](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/4459e0cee8b6d043ab2b06cbd89545c45a76a612/runtime/lua/vim/uri.lua#L104-L106).",
