        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Apologies, the check with `buflisted` was indeed unneeded. The intention was to check whether the buf_id was a URI if it were unlisted (which should have used `vim.uri_from_bufnr` regardless, my bad) but, at least in jdtls, it seems the URI becomes a listed buffer prior to jumping, so the original buflisted check can remain.",
